{"type":"text","timestamp":1790404647606,"sessionID":"ses_f2396f5afffediyaoJsQudqW31","part":{"id":"prt_0dc6edaa7001y3twuO55jZpq0h","messageID":"msg_0dc6c153f001cVNILF0gSr0i58","sessionID":"ses_f2396f5afffediyaoJsQudqW31","type":"text","text":"I’m implementing the requested lifecycle directly: state registration and guarded transitions, card input/target forwarding, drag timing and release behavior, plus hand restoration at `original_index`. The hand callback will ignore the initial base-state signal while a card is already in the hand, preventing startup reordering.","time":{"start":1790404647591,"end":1790404647593},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"msg_069770194270faf8016ab7681ca5a487d1836c483a2cd3e602","phase":"commentary"}}}}
